nce at kairo's hand what might have  been a crazy reveal to them ended up  being an anticlimactic but hilarious  revenge after uroshi transformed into  his eight-headed form and arrogantly  talked about how he would finish off the  injured red scabbards the scabbards went  on to slice off all of his heads  effortlessly commenting on how they have  no time to waste on the likes of hirochi  now this is as far as we got when i  dropped the previous mythical zones  video at that point we weren't 100 sure  orochi would survive having all of his  heads taken off but i mentioned it  wouldn't be surprising if he did  considering his mythical zone fruit and  as if to not disrespect a mythical zone  oda did in fact have orochi survive even  those malty beheadings it seems like  huntress flame finally took him out in  the latest chapter and for him to  finally die hiyori had to neutralize his  mythical zone power with the help of sea  prism stone nails in the end the yamata  no rochi is a very interesting fruit  with unique abilities like most mythical  zone fruits i honestly don't even know  what if anything would have killed him  if he or he didn't neutralize his fruit  powers but cool fruits don't always go  to cool or even strong characters and  this is one of those times although i  found the fruit fascinating oroshi  himself was definitely not worthy of the  mythical fruit for number three let's  look at a character who is definitely  worthy of his mythical zone fruit dr  marco the phoenix marco is as legendary  as yonko commanders come he was the  right hand man to whitebeard the man  called the strongest in the world and  the closest to the one piece he is  currently 45 years old and his birthday  is in october like mine coincidence i  think not he's six foot eight inches  tall which is almost like me like a bit  taller but almost like me and his bounty  is  1.374 billion berries a bounty bigger  than queen's impressive bounty of 1.32  billion berries so even among yonko  commanders his bounty is top tier  although since the last video it was  revealed that king actually had a higher  bounty at 1.39 billion how crazy is it  that an injured zorro beat a dude with a  higher bounty than marco absolutely  insane to think how far our crew has  come and yeah people will be like bro  it's not all about bounty you can't  determine strength based off of solely  bounty and i know but you can't just  ignore the hype around bounties either  i'm just saying of course marco the  phoenix has the phoenix fruit more  specifically the toritorino me model  phoenix or the berg bird fruit model  phoenix another way to translate it is  as immortal bird another hype detail  about the mythical fruit back in chapter  553 we first saw marco use his ability  and it was to deflect an admiral's  attack no less without breaking a sweat  marco's fruit allows him to adopt the  properties of a phoenix or to straight  up fully transform into a blue phoenix  marco's blue flames allow him to heal  himself or others this is one of the  reasons that the immortal bird  translation is so apt because marco can  seemingly heal from otherwise lethal  wounds using blue flames it's like an  enhanced logia because marco can take  hits as if they just went through him  but in his case he could also use the  blue flames to heal from haki infused  attacks as well as mentioned marco could  block admiral kizuru's attack and he  also successfully blocked admiral  akainu's attack as well during the  paramount war and he would later have no  lasting damage showing just how superior  this fruit is to ace's flame flame fruit  which was easily defeated by akainu he  was able to use his fruit for a while to  also hold his own while fighting against  king and queen at the same time two  yonko commanders with both confirmed  bounties over a billion berries  obviously this doesn't mean he could  actually beat them both at the same time  and perospero pointed out that he looked  exhausted but it's still very impressive  considering how good of a fighter marco  is in battle it's all the more  impressive that he can be just as  helpful when it comes to healing others  he's used his flames to help heal others  and more specifically he's used them as  a way to help prevent the further spread  of queen's virus in many people notably  marco's flames won't burn you as they  burn like conventional flames but they  can definitely be used to reinforce the  power of his attacks so the op power  comes with both offensive defensive and  healing capabilities notably oda has  told us that marco's healing has  limitations in a question corner so he's  not necessarily immortal in his phoenix  form it's quite likely that if marco  drains all his stamina he won't be able  to use his healing powers which might  explain why he sometimes leaves minor  wounds like scratches or bruises  unhealed in battle another way that  marco could definitely be killed is if  you exposed him to sea stone then he  won't be able to use his regeneration on  mortal wounds it should be said that  marco's forces fought against  blackbeard's forces in the payback war  about a year after the paramount war and  marco's side was obliterated even so  marco made it out fine without suffering  lasting wounds thanks to his phoenix  powers but i think that's enough about  marco for the purposes of this video his  mythical fruit is one of my favorites  and though it has its limits it's let  marco at the very least exchange blows  with many of the best fighters in the  world without taking any lasting damage  next up we have kaido the leader of the  beast pirates and the man called the  strongest creature in the world kaido's  bounty is over 4.6 billion berries  meaning among the living yonko he has  the highest bounty but probably not for  long as we'll get into later on in the  video so the question was for a long  time what exact devil fruit did kaido  have what mythical zone is worthy of  going to the