sting scar on him still there's  no doubt that this is one of the best  devil fruits of all it even makes the  sea a usual devil through weakness a  non-issue because the dragon form can  just fly over it i think that's enough  kaido for this video because we do have  others to cover but let's just say this  fruit did not disappoint in the least  next let's look at sengoku the former  fleet admiral and living legend he was  one of the major figures back during  goldie rogers time along with whitebeard  shiki and gar after time skip this dude  is 79 years old he has an especially  interesting mythical zone fruit namely  the hitohito no me model daibutsu or the  human human fruit model buddha he has  the ability to transform into a giant  gold buddha and notably back when i did  the first mythical zone video this was  the only confirmed human human mythical  zone fruit but we'll be adding two more  newly confirmed human human mythical  zone fruits to the list this time around  but back to sengoku for now during  chapter 578 at marine ford we see his  giant form launch shock waves at  blackbeard blackbeard and his crew are  shown to be rattled by the attack whited  out eyes blood and all that jazz but  obviously the attack doesn't keep  blackbeard down obviously sengoku's size  and physical power in this form are  great and although he failed to execute  ace with a punch thanks to luffy's  inflated stomach and a candle wall his  power still led to the execution  platform collapsing and that is it for  sengoku we haven't seen much of his  power in action but what we have seen  was no doubt epic definitely a power  fitting for a former fleet admiral next  up we have yamato kaido's child and  number one odin fan as us weekly manga  readers found out more or less recently  yamato also has a mythical zone fruit  namely the inuinomi model okuchi no  makami or the dog dog fruit model okuchi  no makami we're told that it is a rare  mythical wolf and that it is a guardian  spir