e how accurate the  description is as the story progresses  and luffy continues to use his new  awakened powers so far we've seen luffy  use his awakened fruit to grab kaido's  dragon form like he was a mere snake toy  and pull him up to the roof he proceeded  to practically enter a toon world he  spun kaido around and slammed him into  the ground over and over again kaido's  eyes pop out like in looney tunes  suggesting that luffy can make his  opponents take on these exaggerated  characteristics not just himself and we  see that in a later chapter as luffy  blows himself up inside kaido and kaido  stretches in super unnatural ways we  also see luffy pull a popeye and summon  massive muscles all of a sudden we also  see him enter this insane god size mode  where he becomes as i previously alluded  to larger than kaido himself and can use  kaido's dragon form as a skipping rope  which was hilarious i mean if he is  strong enough to do all of this to kaido  i doubt there's any opponent he can't  lift he also rubberized the ground and  lifted it up to deflect a blast breath  showing his awakened powers can  definitely affect his surroundings so  yeah this was definitely an epic reveal  and awakening and i look forward to  seeing all of the other details that  continue to come out about luffy's new  powers since there will no doubt be more  and more details and upgrades coming out  about the form until the story ends the  other mythical human human fruit that i  have to add is the hitohito no me model  onyudo aka human human fruit mythical  model onyudo onyudo translates to big  monk and is a reference to a large monk  yokai in japanese folklore the current  user is onimaru a fox that used to be  friends with master swordsman shimotsuki  ushimaru the zorro look alike like with  chopper the fruit has given onimaru an  animal the ability to turn into a human  more or less and in his giant monk form  where he towers over zorro he can speak  as well in his humanoid form he