o the  comments and rank that vampire accent  out of 10. back to the video his victims  age quickly as a result of the blood  sucking while redfield becomes stronger  and through these means gains access to  eternal youth next up we have the  toritorinomi model nue aka the bird bird  fruit model nue this fruit was featured  in the one piece art nue a series of  artwork created for the one piece x  kyoto event in 2017 that depicts a  non-canon story of the straw hats in  wano the fruit was eaten by toratsugu a  resident of wano which is fitting  because the nue is a mythical japanese  yokai it's a chimera beast that borrows  different body parts from different  animals for instance it has the face of  a monkey the body of a tiger the mane of  a lion and a snake for a tail when  toratsugu transforms into the yokai he  has the ability to fly but is  nevertheless overpowered relatively  quickly by luffy oda himself drew the  climactic scene where luffy battles the  new way for the final mythical zone user  we turn to the same video game we  already mentioned specifically to one  piece unlimited world red again in this  video game we also find out about  inuinomi model bakedanuki literally  translated to dog dog fruit model  monster raccoon dog it allows its user  to transform into a tanooki monster and  it was eaten by get this a pen once  again oda designed the mythical zone pen  called pato and pato belongs to the  already mentioned redfield pato may not  be the most op mythical zone user but  he's definitely interesting he can use  the tip of his tail to write and  furthermore has the ability to transform  leaves into objects and people by  writing on them and that is it all 11  mythical zone users from one piece  updated video games and art exhibitions  included and their powers explained  thank you so much for staying tuned  until the end and let me know which  mythical zone you'd want it can be from  this list or you can get creative and  pick from a myth we haven